      "description": "The DMARC record at _dmarc.aajtak.in is not valid: no p= tag; RFC 7489 requires a policy. RFC 7489 section 6.6.3 says a receiver given a record with no valid policy and no valid reporting address applies no DMARC processing, so the domain is unprotected despite appearing configured.",
      "impact": "The domain has the appearance of DMARC protection and none of the effect.",
      "remediation": "Rewrite the record so it begins 'v=DMARC1; p=<policy>;' - the version tag must come first and the policy tag must immediately follow it. Give each tag once. Other tags may follow in any order.",
