      "remediation": "Publish an SPF record listing your senders and ending in -all, sign your mail with DKIM, then publish 'v=DMARC1; p=reject; rua=mailto:dmarc@aajtak.in' at _dmarc.aajtak.in. Move to p=reject only after the rua reports show every legitimate sender passing.",
